latter should be used as a typeclass argument in theorems because Lean can autom
atically deduce
`TopologicalSpace.SeparableSpace` from `SecondCountableTopology` using
`TopologicalSpace.SecondCountableTopology.to_separableSpace`, but deducing
`SecondCountableTopology` from `TopologicalSpace.SeparableSpace` requires more a
ssumptions.
